  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved healthcare for target populations in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to improve the health of people affected by conflict and climate change. This is in support of the Nigerian Red Cross&#x2019; mandated role in providing facility-based health services and community-based health promotion and care. The project aims at an improved and safer access to healthcare for targeted populations.</narrative>
  </description>
